Package: spicyglm
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Co-Localisation Inference with a Fast CR2 Sandwich Variance
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Elijah", "Willie", email = "ewillie0004@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R front end for the spicyGLM numeric core, a port of spicyGLM()
    from spicyR's gee branch. For each reference cell the number of target cells
    within a radius is modelled as Poisson with a log-density offset, or the
    number of target cells among its k nearest neighbours as Binomial with a
    logit background-proportion offset. One coefficient per condition, tested
    with a cluster-robust CR2 variance and Satterthwaite degrees of freedom.
    The C++17 core is shared with the Python front end in the same repository.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
SystemRequirements: C++17
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
